1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:34,608 --> 00:01:37,260
Damn them, attacking our All-Stars...!

20
00:01:49,608 --> 00:01:51,173
I would not do that...

21
00:01:51,217 --> 00:01:53,565
Yes!
Kawamatsu!

22
00:01:53,565 --> 00:01:56,478
Yeah, let's beat them to a pulp!

23
00:01:56,478 --> 00:01:58,435
Hey, boys!

24
00:01:58,435 --> 00:02:00,956
Don't even think about...

25
00:02:01,435 --> 00:02:03,217
...giving them a hand...

26
00:02:03,782 --> 00:02:05,912
...in their duels!

27
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,783
But Kingpin Hyogoro,
they're up against the All-Stars!

28
00:02:10,608 --> 00:02:15,347
Whether friend or foe, you will keep
anyone and everyone from their fight!

29
00:02:15,782 --> 00:02:17,043
See!

30
00:02:17,043 --> 00:02:21,912
"Don't get in our way"
is written all over their faces!

31
00:02:35,217 --> 00:02:37,608
All that's at the top
of the Red Line...

32
00:02:37,608 --> 00:02:41,260
...is Mary Geoise, yup.

33
00:02:46,086 --> 00:02:49,782
And you're not the kinda guy
to ask the gods for help, yup.

34
00:02:49,782 --> 00:02:52,130
You're drunk
off your ass, huh, Pops?

35
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,739
You bet I am!

36
00:02:55,913 --> 00:03:01,391
And those oh-so-great Celestial Dragons
live up there in Mary Geoise, yup.

37
00:03:04,782 --> 00:03:06,043
No "gods" there.

38
00:03:06,043 --> 00:03:11,521
Nah, I'm talking about
way, way back.

39
00:03:12,086 --> 00:03:15,651
Long before Mary Geoise.

40
00:03:17,565 --> 00:03:21,347
Heard there was this
"Land of the Gods" up there.

41
00:03:21,826 --> 00:03:23,869
Land of the Gods"?

42
00:03:23,869 --> 00:03:27,086
Saying stuff like that
ain't like you, Pops.

43
00:03:29,347 --> 00:03:34,564
A long, long time ago,
upon the red wall...

44
00:03:49,739 --> 00:03:52,391
Hey, Marco!
No sleeping on the job!

45
00:03:52,826 --> 00:03:53,956
This is war!

46
00:03:55,782 --> 00:03:57,999
I was just waiting
for you to help out.

47
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,348
Foolishness!
We are leaving!

48
00:04:03,347 --> 00:04:06,434
Izo...
Believe in any gods?

49
00:04:06,435 --> 00:04:08,608
You sound like Pops
when he was drunk!

50
00:04:09,478 --> 00:04:11,608
Yo, bros!

51
00:04:11,608 --> 00:04:14,391
Don't think for a sec
that you're gonna beat us!

52
00:04:16,347 --> 00:04:19,738
Your attacks did squat to us!

53
00:04:22,347 --> 00:04:24,999
Listen up, and listen good!

54
00:04:38,521 --> 00:04:42,521
We are Kaido-san's protectors:
The Three Calamities!

55
00:04:42,521 --> 00:04:46,304
They call us the All-Stars
because we're unbeatable!

56
00:05:00,696 --> 00:05:02,348
What's wrong with you?

57
00:05:02,913 --> 00:05:08,086
Well, after I put on my Raid Suit
for the third time, my body's felt off...

58
00:05:08,086 --> 00:05:10,347
Just don't trip me up, got it?

59
00:05:10,347 --> 00:05:13,086
Didn't say anything about
being under the weather...

60
00:05:13,086 --> 00:05:14,086
Just feelin' weird.

61
00:05:14,739 --> 00:05:16,217
Maybe it's your eyebrows?

62
00:05:16,217 --> 00:05:18,695
I told you, it's my body.

63
00:05:25,174 --> 00:05:27,087
First one you owe me.

64
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:30,347
Bridal Grabber!

65
00:05:32,478 --> 00:05:34,000
Back down to zero.

66
00:05:39,304 --> 00:05:43,782
Germa!

67
00:05:44,696 --> 00:05:50,086
I heard all you kids of his're cyborgs!

68
00:05:50,086 --> 00:05:55,129
Vinsmoke Judge...
Totally nuts, the madman!

69
00:05:55,130 --> 00:05:58,260
That flaming leg
of yours a machine?

70
00:05:59,086 --> 00:06:03,173
Too bad for you!
I'm a hundred percent human, unlike them!

71
00:06:03,565 --> 00:06:06,043
Humans can't just
turn flames on like that, dumbass!

72
00:06:06,652 --> 00:06:09,652
Unless you're a Lunarian, that is!

73
00:06:10,608 --> 00:06:12,173
Oh, but we can!

74
00:06:13,435 --> 00:06:15,043
Turn up the heat, that is!

75
00:06:15,043 --> 00:06:19,651
My passion burns
hotter than any fire!

76
00:06:22,391 --> 00:06:24,956
I can even cook up some
Sea Monster dishes with it,

77
00:06:24,957 --> 00:06:26,652
you dumb dino!

78
00:06:29,739 --> 00:06:34,174
I'm gonna show you
what cyborgs're really made of...

79
00:06:34,174 --> 00:06:36,260
Somethin' even
Vegapunk can't recreate!

80
00:06:37,391 --> 00:06:40,348
Eyes on me, black mummy!

81
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:57,130
The hell kinda blade is that?!

82
00:07:04,043 --> 00:07:07,477
I get it now...
You're a killing machine...

83
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:17,130
Does one need
styles and forms in a fight?

84
00:07:17,130 --> 00:07:21,782
Right...
You never called yourself a swordsman.

85
00:07:21,782 --> 00:07:23,565
Have it your way.

86
00:07:23,565 --> 00:07:28,651
Who knows, by the end of this
I might be tearing your throat out with my teeth.

87
00:07:31,826 --> 00:07:35,086
Whatever it takes to win!

88
00:07:35,521 --> 00:07:37,130
Kingpin Hyogoro.

89
00:07:39,696 --> 00:07:43,739
When Hiyori-sama said
she would bequeath Enma upon him,

90
00:07:43,739 --> 00:07:46,522
there was a reason
I could not stop her.

91
00:07:50,174 --> 00:07:56,217
If indeed your blade is Shusui,
I ask that you would render it unto the Land of Wano.

92
00:07:56,217 --> 00:07:58,869
I told you! That's mine!

93
00:08:01,217 --> 00:08:02,826
You shall have a replacement!

94
00:08:04,086 --> 00:08:07,738
A sword bequeathed to me
by my departed father...

95
00:08:08,217 --> 00:08:10,260
It shall be yours...

96
00:08:15,957 --> 00:08:19,348
Well, if you're trading one-for-one...

97
00:08:28,174 --> 00:08:33,478
Yeah, I know why you couldn't.
He's a pirate from abroad, yet it's strange...

98
00:08:34,869 --> 00:08:37,869
He is the spitting image of
the Daimyo of Ringo,

99
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:49,130
Shimotsuki Ushimaru,
in his prime.

100
00:08:52,086 --> 00:08:54,695
Quite right!
Right down to his swordplay!

101
00:08:58,739 --> 00:09:02,521
Ushimaru-sama was a descendant
of the God of the Blade, Shimotsuki Ryuma,

102
00:09:02,521 --> 00:09:03,956
and a great swordsman.

103
00:09:04,435 --> 00:09:10,174
Even the fact that he returned Shusui
to the Land of Wano feels like 'twas fate.

104
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,783
That, and Ryuma being a
one-eyed samurai himself...

105
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,043
Hit a wall, huh...

106
00:10:07,043 --> 00:10:11,782
And you can't even take your Sulong form,
with no way for moonlight to reach you in here!

107
00:10:11,782 --> 00:10:15,260
Bedtime for you, Day King!

108
00:10:19,565 --> 00:10:21,695
M'II let off...

109
00:10:22,957 --> 00:10:26,043
...that pile of rubble you call a country,
for keeping up the lie...

110
00:10:26,478 --> 00:10:29,043
...that there was no samurai there!

111
00:10:37,869 --> 00:10:40,782
Bring Raizo to me, dammit!

112
00:10:40,782 --> 00:10:42,782
Or this time I'm loppin' it off!

113
00:10:42,782 --> 00:10:45,999
I swear to God that I don't know
anyone named Raizo!

114
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:49,000
If there's anyone by that name here,
I'll slice my stomach open!

115
00:10:49,957 --> 00:10:51,739
Oh, yeah?

116
00:10:51,739 --> 00:10:53,478
In that case...!

117
00:11:00,565 --> 00:11:04,738
Had we sold out Raizo then...

118
00:11:04,739 --> 00:11:07,174
...our shame would
have been so unbearable...

119
00:11:10,478 --> 00:11:14,086
...that we would not have
dared return here, to Wano!

120
00:11:14,086 --> 00:11:15,912
Those your last words?

121
00:11:16,565 --> 00:11:18,956
Lemme help you end it all...
by removing your head!

122
00:11:24,043 --> 00:11:26,651
Ever since the day Oden-sama died...

123
00:11:26,652 --> 00:11:29,217
we spent every
waking moment...

124
00:11:32,696 --> 00:11:35,869
...preparing for this,
our final battle!

125
00:11:49,826 --> 00:11:53,782
For two decades,
we asked ourselves:

126
00:11:53,782 --> 00:11:55,695
"Are you still Oden-sama's...

127
00:11:56,652 --> 00:11:58,435
"...samurai?!"

128
00:11:58,782 --> 00:12:00,695
Y-You damned dirty dog!

129
00:12:01,174 --> 00:12:02,826
That form!

130
00:12:02,826 --> 00:12:06,043
How are you in Sulong form?!

131
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:11,130
A hole in the ceiling?!

132
00:12:17,565 --> 00:12:19,130
You will not...

133
00:12:19,217 --> 00:12:23,869
...Stain the name of
Kozuki Oden any longer!

134
00:12:40,217 --> 00:12:44,347
Even if our
millennium-old city crumbled...

135
00:12:48,043 --> 00:12:52,129
...we had to forge our way here,
to our ultimate battle!

136
00:12:55,739 --> 00:12:59,174
No matter who among us dies,
we shall win this battle...

137
00:13:08,174 --> 00:13:11,391
and the Dawn shall come
for the world!

138
00:13:20,565 --> 00:13:23,173
The enemy just keeps
flooding out of the castle!

139
00:13:36,696 --> 00:13:41,087
This is where our fates
shall be decided!

140
00:13:41,652 --> 00:13:44,739
Piss off!
This is our castle!

141
00:13:44,739 --> 00:13:47,782
Get outta our way,
damned samurai!

142
00:13:47,782 --> 00:13:52,652
Leave, and nobody gets hurt!

143
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:02,478
Carrot, Wanda!

144
00:14:02,957 --> 00:14:04,565
Master Nekomamushi!

145
00:14:04,608 --> 00:14:08,956
Preciate you-gara all
savin' some for me.

146
00:14:08,957 --> 00:14:11,043
I'll take it from here!

147
00:14:12,565 --> 00:14:17,521
If it weren't fer Pedro,
Luffy 'n the others wouldn't be here!

148
00:14:17,521 --> 00:14:20,869
This raid would be
one big flop!

149
00:14:20,869 --> 00:14:25,695
Pedro, huh?
Looking to get revenge for that jaguar?!

150
00:14:26,869 --> 00:14:29,652
What an awfully beautiful...

151
00:14:29,652 --> 00:14:33,348
...full moon tonight!

152
00:14:37,174 --> 00:14:40,043
Pedro!
Watch over us!

153
00:14:40,043 --> 00:14:42,651
Hope yer enjoyin'
a drink or two, meow!

154
00:14:48,608 --> 00:14:51,478
But fer you, Lick-Spittle...

155
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:57,304
This's the last moon...

156
00:14:58,304 --> 00:15:01,260
...ye'll ever see!

157
00:15:08,826 --> 00:15:13,956
Now that Oden is dead,
watching you idiot ghosts serve his brat is comical!

158
00:15:14,869 --> 00:15:17,391
Shut your mouth!
Youth is nothing to laugh at!

159
00:15:17,391 --> 00:15:20,565
Just as people like us
grew up to become Samurai,

160
00:15:20,565 --> 00:15:22,999
others do the same!

161
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:27,043
Wano shall watch over Momonosuke-sama
as he transforms into a man!

162
00:15:27,086 --> 00:15:30,303
And that is why we will not allow your ilk
to steal away our country!

163
00:15:30,304 --> 00:15:32,173
Clone Technique!

164
00:15:36,957 --> 00:15:40,261
To my ninja techniques,
I commit all my strength...

165
00:15:40,347 --> 00:15:43,608
...So that I may lay waste
to enemies of the Kozuki!

166
00:15:46,869 --> 00:15:48,478
Y-You gotta be kidding me!

167
00:15:55,478 --> 00:15:59,869
W... W-W-What's
goin' on here?!

168
00:16:00,217 --> 00:16:02,739
A-A-A dragon?!

169
00:16:02,739 --> 00:16:04,565
Why's he here?!

170
00:16:04,565 --> 00:16:07,086
Why S Kaido here?!

171
00:16:07,086 --> 00:16:09,564
Can we even manage to fight him?!

172
00:16:09,565 --> 00:16:11,608
Don't ask me to join in!

173
00:16:18,782 --> 00:16:21,826
I am no morsel!

174
00:16:21,826 --> 00:16:24,304
If you dare attempt to eat me,
I shall devour you first!

175
00:16:24,608 --> 00:16:26,565
Restrain yourself!

176
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:33,087
It's dangerous over there, Straw Hat!
Stay away from him!

177
00:16:45,565 --> 00:16:46,478
That you, Momo?

178
00:16:47,086 --> 00:16:48,695
Indeed.

179
00:16:48,696 --> 00:16:51,174
That's...
the runt we saw earlier?!

180
00:16:51,174 --> 00:16:52,608
What the hell's going on?!

181
00:16:52,608 --> 00:16:54,086
Nuuuuh?!

182
00:16:54,086 --> 00:16:57,521
'Tis the work of my
Ripe-Ripe Technique!

183
00:16:57,565 --> 00:17:03,217
At Momonosuke-sama's request,
he is now twenty-eight years of age!

184
00:17:03,217 --> 00:17:05,087
You can do that?

185
00:17:07,435 --> 00:17:08,695
Why the tears, though?

186
00:17:10,521 --> 00:17:11,782
Because...!

187
00:17:15,739 --> 00:17:19,565
Momonosuke-sama!
You are the spitting image of...!

188
00:17:30,826 --> 00:17:31,956
All right!

189
00:17:33,565 --> 00:17:34,912
Let's go, Momo...

190
00:17:35,652 --> 00:17:37,913
We're gonna take back Wano!

191
00:17:38,957 --> 00:17:40,000
Aye!

192
00:17:56,304 --> 00:17:57,260
Huuuh?!

193
00:18:00,869 --> 00:18:02,478
They all keeled over!

194
00:18:03,869 --> 00:18:05,521
What's with you guys?!

195
00:18:05,521 --> 00:18:06,738
Get a grip!

196
00:18:07,739 --> 00:18:09,782
ND-Did you just...

197
00:18:09,782 --> 00:18:12,739
...use Conqueror's Haki, croc?!

198
00:18:15,478 --> 00:18:17,174
Caught me red-handed...

199
00:18:17,174 --> 00:18:19,217
Miknew it, croc!

200
00:18:21,347 --> 00:18:22,564
It's not your fault!

201
00:18:22,565 --> 00:18:26,825
You just don't have the willpower to
stay conscious in my overwhelming presence!

202
00:18:26,826 --> 00:18:29,173
I'm the guy that took out
two of the Flying Six!

203
00:18:29,652 --> 00:18:32,913
Usohachi the Sibling Hunter!

204
00:18:32,957 --> 00:18:34,782
The Flying Six!!

205
00:18:34,782 --> 00:18:36,391
Two of them?!

206
00:18:40,608 --> 00:18:44,738
Can't beat me? Join me!

207
00:18:53,304 --> 00:18:57,477
I dun get what's goin' on,
but it's pretty amazin"

208
00:18:57,913 --> 00:19:01,347
It's because Big Mom is fighting
on the same floor.

209
00:19:01,347 --> 00:19:05,869
The rank-and-file here fell like dominoes
in the wake of her Conqueror's Haki.

210
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:08,782
Franky!

211
00:19:08,782 --> 00:19:11,739
Any idea what happened to Luffy?

212
00:19:11,739 --> 00:19:13,739
Not a damn clue...

213
00:19:13,739 --> 00:19:16,652
But what Momo said earlier
is all that matters, yeah?

214
00:19:16,652 --> 00:19:19,000
Luffy yet lives!

215
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:23,739
He speaks to me now!
Saying that he shall return!

216
00:19:24,782 --> 00:19:28,999
Shinobu-chan's supposed to be with him,
but I can't reach her!

217
00:19:30,826 --> 00:19:33,652
No news is good news!

218
00:19:33,652 --> 00:19:36,217
Come on, what's that
supposed to mean?!

219
00:19:36,217 --> 00:19:38,565
Come on down when you're done
doing what you gotta!

220
00:19:40,826 --> 00:19:45,391
For some reason, the bad guys're
hitting the Performance Floor non-stop.

221
00:19:45,435 --> 00:19:47,347
We could use a hand!

222
00:19:47,347 --> 00:19:49,086
Huh? The Performance Floor?

223
00:19:49,086 --> 00:19:50,521
Clik.

224
00:19:50,521 --> 00:19:51,956
Yo, jerks!

225
00:19:51,957 --> 00:19:54,652
Don't let 'em through!

226
00:19:54,652 --> 00:19:59,609
Zoro and Sanji're fighting the All-Stars
on the Performance Floor!

227
00:20:01,435 --> 00:20:04,260
Don't tell me what to do!
Aye-aye!

228
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:06,521
We're all equals in an alliance!

229
00:20:11,304 --> 00:20:14,651
Ouch! Hooothothot!
I think I feel hot!

230
00:20:14,652 --> 00:20:18,521
Though I'm already cremated!

231
00:20:18,521 --> 00:20:21,478
Wait!
Who dares say I'm cremated?!

232
00:20:24,739 --> 00:20:27,043
Robin-san is going to burn up!

233
00:20:27,043 --> 00:20:29,216
Baron Corpse!
Are you all right?!

234
00:20:30,521 --> 00:20:33,391
We can no longer
stay in the castle.

235
00:20:33,391 --> 00:20:36,000
Would any of you know
how the war is faring?

236
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:38,391
No, it's just chaos everywhere...

237
00:20:38,435 --> 00:20:42,782
But I did see the First Son of the Sea,
Jinbe, on the fourth floor!

238
00:21:01,608 --> 00:21:04,130
Arabesque Brick Fist!

239
00:21:13,174 --> 00:21:18,260
I reckon your captain is
still fighting Kaido, yes?

240
00:21:18,260 --> 00:21:21,738
Wouldn't know...
I was wondering that myself.

241
00:21:21,739 --> 00:21:25,521
That so...
The whole situation is a right mess.

242
00:21:25,521 --> 00:21:28,695
We need to ferret out
where the key players are...

243
00:21:28,696 --> 00:21:32,043
Ring, ring, ring...
Ring, ring, ring... clik.

244
00:21:32,043 --> 00:21:35,173
Jinbe-san! Jinbe-san!
We have a problem!

245
00:21:35,174 --> 00:21:38,391
The third floor will
soon be engulfed in fire!

246
00:21:38,391 --> 00:21:40,695
You must descend while you can!

247
00:21:40,696 --> 00:21:44,174
Fire?
That's definitely not good...

248
00:21:44,174 --> 00:21:46,043
But who, exactly...

249
00:21:46,608 --> 00:21:49,825
...is holding Kaido at bay
up there?

250
00:21:54,565 --> 00:21:56,217
Narikabura Arrow!

251
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,913
Vajra Arrow!

252
00:22:14,869 --> 00:22:17,043
You...

253
00:22:18,347 --> 00:22:20,651
...can't be Oden!

254
00:22:22,086 --> 00:22:24,216
You have always...

255
00:22:24,217 --> 00:22:25,608
...been trying to kill me!

256
00:22:26,086 --> 00:22:28,173
Yeah, that's right.

257
00:22:28,174 --> 00:22:30,608
This ain't some
father-son quarrel.

258
00:22:30,608 --> 00:22:35,260
If you really wanna call yourself "Oden,"
you better be ready for war!

259
00:22:35,260 --> 00:22:37,217
I don't play games,

260
00:22:37,217 --> 00:22:38,782
Yamato!

261
00:22:43,347 --> 00:22:44,869
Is admiring someone...

262
00:22:45,391 --> 00:22:46,739
...a sin?!

263
00:22:52,174 --> 00:22:54,043
1...

264
00:22:54,043 --> 00:22:56,260
...love Oden!

265
00:23:07,521 --> 00:23:08,391
Away with you!

266
00:23:08,435 --> 00:23:12,043
I will defend the Land of Wano!

267
00:23:13,826 --> 00:23:16,826
Open Wano's borders!

268
00:23:16,826 --> 00:23:18,826
Just brutal, man!

269
00:23:18,826 --> 00:23:21,782
She's been like that
for a week now!

270
00:23:21,782 --> 00:23:23,173
Don't back down now!

271
00:23:23,652 --> 00:23:28,696
She's got Kaido-san's blood in her veins,
but she's still just a little kid!

272
00:23:29,260 --> 00:23:31,260
Brute force her into stopping!

273
00:23:31,347 --> 00:23:32,651
Brave words!

274
00:23:32,652 --> 00:23:35,826
Then stop me,
if you can!

275
00:23:46,435 --> 00:23:48,435
Stop fighting already!

276
00:23:48,957 --> 00:23:50,261
Yamato-sama!

277
00:23:50,913 --> 00:23:51,783
Wrong!

278
00:23:52,304 --> 00:23:52,999
I am...

279
00:23:54,608 --> 00:23:57,043
...Oden!

280
00:24:04,608 --> 00:24:06,521
What just happened?

281
00:24:23,608 --> 00:24:25,695
This your doing?

282
00:24:26,696 --> 00:24:27,913
Yamato.

283
00:24:27,913 --> 00:24:30,696
wwww
Wrong!
I am Oden!

284
00:24:30,696 --> 00:24:31,913
I...

285
00:24:35,782 --> 00:24:37,434
am Oden!

286
00:24:37,435 --> 00:24:41,739
Answer me, Yamato!
Did you do this?

287
00:24:41,739 --> 00:24:45,087
I do not know...
They all fell on their own.

288
00:24:47,521 --> 00:24:50,869
Hey!
Unchain me, Father!

289
00:24:50,869 --> 00:24:53,086
I am starving to death!

290
00:24:53,739 --> 00:24:57,043
I see...
It's the Color of the Conqueror.

291
00:24:57,043 --> 00:24:58,303
You show promise.

292
00:24:59,435 --> 00:25:02,174
But if you're gonna keep
calling yourself Oden,

293
00:25:02,174 --> 00:25:03,086
die!

294
00:25:03,086 --> 00:25:04,434
Yamato!

295
00:25:04,435 --> 00:25:05,130
Huh?

296
00:25:05,130 --> 00:25:07,000
Whaaa!!

297
00:25:11,696 --> 00:25:14,565
I'll give you a month...

298
00:25:14,565 --> 00:25:17,565
How 'bout you
cool your head while you're here?

299
00:25:20,782 --> 00:25:25,130
Wait! How can you just leave me
in a dark place like this?!

300
00:25:26,086 --> 00:25:27,825
A-A month, sir?

301
00:25:27,826 --> 00:25:31,999
The Ogre Princess may be tough,
but even she would die!

302
00:25:32,347 --> 00:25:37,260
Besides, there are vicious
Wano samurai behind that door...

303
00:25:38,174 --> 00:25:41,174
Just like that idiot over there...

304
00:25:42,086 --> 00:25:44,564
You've got a month.

305
00:25:45,826 --> 00:25:49,521
If any of you change your minds,
shout through the air hole in the ceiling.

306
00:25:49,521 --> 00:25:51,869
If you decide you wanna be
one of my soldiers,

307
00:25:51,869 --> 00:25:54,217
I'll let you out of there.

308
00:25:54,217 --> 00:25:57,391
How many days have the
bunch of you been without food?

309
00:25:57,696 --> 00:26:00,087
Hey!
Bring 'em some food!

310
00:26:00,652 --> 00:26:01,435
But...

311
00:26:01,957 --> 00:26:03,739
...just for one person.

312
00:26:07,696 --> 00:26:10,826
Samurai gotta have
their swords, am I right?

313
00:26:11,565 --> 00:26:12,608
Father!

314
00:26:14,608 --> 00:26:18,956
I am the child of Kaido!
I know they bear me ill will!

315
00:26:18,957 --> 00:26:22,957
If you leave swords for them,
they will kill me right away!

316
00:26:22,957 --> 00:26:25,608
What're you talking about?

317
00:26:25,608 --> 00:26:27,912
You're Oden, aren't you?

318
00:26:40,130 --> 00:26:42,043
I may be Oden, but...

319
00:26:42,652 --> 00:26:45,652
...I am also the son of Kaido,
Oden's murderer.

320
00:26:48,565 --> 00:26:51,738
I know the Samurai
will absolutely loathe me!

321
00:26:53,826 --> 00:26:56,912
Father wants us
to fight each other to the death!

322
00:26:57,652 --> 00:26:59,652
And over a meal!

323
00:27:08,696 --> 00:27:10,609
No, before that...

324
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:13,261
They will kill me!

325
00:27:23,174 --> 00:27:24,826
Eat, please.

326
00:27:25,347 --> 00:27:26,999
Uh?
Wha?!

327
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,261
No need to be so reserved!

328
00:27:30,782 --> 00:27:33,478
Samurai do not feel hunger, you see.

329
00:27:33,478 --> 00:27:35,869
A-Are you sure?

330
00:27:37,913 --> 00:27:38,739
I...

331
00:27:39,304 --> 00:27:40,695
I am very...

332
00:27:41,521 --> 00:27:42,521
...hungry!

333
00:27:42,913 --> 00:27:47,478
If none of you Samurai will eat,
then may I?!

334
00:27:47,739 --> 00:27:51,087
Sure, go on.
Hell of a family you were born into...

335
00:27:54,521 --> 00:27:55,869
Thank you!

336
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:03,087
Samurai are amazing!
Hard to believe you do not feel hunger!

337
00:28:32,217 --> 00:28:35,217
Fank you aww...
Sammmurai...

338
00:28:35,565 --> 00:28:40,086
I'll nebbr fuhget...
duh tashte ub dis meal!

339
00:28:42,608 --> 00:28:43,825
Say...

340
00:28:43,826 --> 00:28:47,782
Can I become a samurai
even though I feel hunger?

341
00:28:54,913 --> 00:28:56,086
Hands in the air.

342
00:28:56,086 --> 00:28:57,564
Y... Yes, sir!

343
00:29:08,174 --> 00:29:09,608
Stay calm, now.

344
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:12,739
You're Kozuki Oden, right?

345
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:14,391
We heard you, after all.

346
00:29:14,391 --> 00:29:17,956
We, too, love that man.

347
00:29:17,957 --> 00:29:20,478
What?!
Are you people his friends?!

348
00:29:20,478 --> 00:29:22,565
What is your name, Samurai?

349
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,391
Asking a defeated samurai his name?

350
00:29:27,869 --> 00:29:30,173
Just call me So-and-So.

351
00:29:32,086 --> 00:29:35,347
I want to read this journal...

352
00:29:35,347 --> 00:29:38,130
...but there are a lot of
difficult characters...

353
00:29:39,043 --> 00:29:41,216
Oden's logbook?!

354
00:29:43,826 --> 00:29:48,521
"The world is made up of four seas
and one long strip of sea.

355
00:29:48,521 --> 00:29:52,565
"Furthermore, the world is round,
much like a shiratama dango.

356
00:29:52,565 --> 00:29:54,912
"It is truly perplexing!"

357
00:29:58,260 --> 00:30:01,347
Ah... How long has it been?
About ten days?

358
00:30:01,347 --> 00:30:05,043
I have no idea...
In here, nothing changes.

359
00:30:05,521 --> 00:30:10,956
Yamato... Is your father really going to
let his child die?

360
00:30:11,347 --> 00:30:16,651
At this rate, we may not be able to see the battle
that Oden said would take place in twenty years.

361
00:30:18,521 --> 00:30:21,869
When that happens,
I will fight...

362
00:30:21,869 --> 00:30:24,695
...alongside the Land of Wano...

363
00:30:25,260 --> 00:30:27,173
And I will set out to sea...

364
00:30:27,826 --> 00:30:31,260
...to become stronger
and stronger...

365
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:35,217
That's reassuring.

366
00:30:35,217 --> 00:30:36,782
Then...

367
00:30:36,782 --> 00:30:40,565
...by not allowing you to die here,

368
00:30:40,957 --> 00:30:43,696
we shall be taking part
in the future war.

369
00:30:44,826 --> 00:30:45,565
Hwuh?

370
00:30:48,478 --> 00:30:50,695
Twenty years is...

371
00:30:50,696 --> 00:30:54,348
...a little too long for us to wait.

372
00:30:56,652 --> 00:31:00,087
Samurai!
If you do that, my father will...!

373
00:31:01,086 --> 00:31:04,477
We would rather not
rot away like this!

374
00:31:04,478 --> 00:31:07,130
We had no intention of
giving in to Kaido...

375
00:31:07,869 --> 00:31:09,695
...from the very beginning!

376
00:31:18,130 --> 00:31:20,608
We leave the
Land of Wano in your hands...

377
00:31:27,739 --> 00:31:31,521
Kaido-sama!
They've shattered the Sacred Stone Door!

378
00:31:31,521 --> 00:31:33,912
Don't let them leave here alive!

379
00:31:35,869 --> 00:31:39,478
There are people who believe in me!

380
00:31:39,869 --> 00:31:41,826
Who accept me!

381
00:31:44,957 --> 00:31:48,043
Why do you want to
take away my freedom?!

382
00:31:48,086 --> 00:31:50,173
And the freedom of
the Land of Wano?!

383
00:31:50,217 --> 00:31:53,956
Life isn't a series of
simple questions and answers!

384
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:55,261
You damned whelp!

385
00:32:02,347 --> 00:32:04,043
Thunder Bagua!

386
00:32:16,521 --> 00:32:17,130
CONTINUED

387
00:32:17,652 --> 00:32:22,043
CONTINUED